Collision & Collision Resolution Techniques
-------------------------------------------
What is Collision?
When two keys produce same index.
Ex: h(x) = x (mod 5) 
For:
Key: 10 -> Hash Value: 0
Key: 15 -> Hash Value: 0
Both go to index 0.This is called Collision.

Consider a = [15, 10, 12, 20], size is 5
h(15) = 15 (mod 5)-> 0
h(10) = 10 (mod 5)-> 0-
  > In 0 index already 15 available
  -> So it is called as collision

Table Visual:
0 | 15 |
1 |    |
2 |    |
3 |    |
4 |    |

Collision Handling Techniques
-----------------------------
Two main techniques:
    1)Chaining
    2)Open Addressing

1)Chaining
----------
Hash Function: h(k) = k (mod m)
Example: m = 5, Keys: 10, 15, 20, 12
Table:
